                <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]">Credit Utilization Guide: Keep Under 30% Rule Explained 2026</h1>
                <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-7 text-slate-500 max-w-[640px]">The 30% rule isn't law — but it's the fastest way to protect 30% of your FICO score. Here's exactly what it means, why lenders watch it, and how to stay under 10% for the best results.</p>

